{"asset_key":"mn/gameplay_story_10640090","episode":"mn","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"10640090","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1064009001:1":{"text":"着きました！","source_cn":"我们到了！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xFE38CE6F0078C295","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1064009001":{"text":"着きました！","source_cn":"我们到了！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xFE38CE6F0078C295","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1064009002:1":{"text":"迷宮と少し似ているかも。","source_cn":"和迷宫的感觉有些类似呢。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x4761150A60C20CDA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1064009003:1":{"text":"皆さんがここに来る前の座標を正確に割り出すためにも、マスターとマルシルさんに、先に空間魔法陣を描いてください。","source_cn":"为了精准地定位你们之前的位置，主人和玛露西尔得提前绘制...","status":"matched_manual_luae_source","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1064009003":{"text":"皆さんがここに来る前の座標を正確に割り出すためにも、マスターとマルシルさんに、先に空間魔法陣を描いてください。","source_cn":"为了精准地定位你们之前的位置，主人和玛露西尔得提前绘制空间魔法阵。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xCD98FC1E7A346287","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1064009004:1":{"text":"なら、他の者たちは料理の下ごしらえを手伝ってもらおうか。","source_cn":"那其他人和老夫一起预处理食材，准备最终的料理吧。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x10DF50E8D52D422F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1064009005:1":{"text":"あなたたちは最後の料理の準備に取りかかった。","source_cn":"你们根据各自的分工，开始准备起了最后的料理。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xB88FF77B15FA9753","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"document:9:420:2":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">【調理法】</style>\n大釜を用意し、材料を順番通りに投入して混ぜる。\n攪拌の際は、時計回りを三周、反時計回りを二周、中身が極彩の黒色になるまで、ひたすらこれを繰り返す。","source_cn":"<style=\"highlight\">【烹制步骤】</style>\n准备一个大坩埚，将材料依序放入后持续搅拌——\n先顺时针三圈，再逆时针两圈，如此反复直至锅内呈现出五彩斑斓的黑色。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5656E91B3E2904B0","variant_status":"","male":"<style=\"highlight\">【調理法】</style>\n大釜を用意し、材料を順番通りに投入して混ぜる。\n攪拌の際は、時計回りを三周、反時計回りを二周、中身が極彩の黒色になるまで、ひたすらこれを繰り返す。","female":"<style=\"highlight\">【調理法】</style>\n大釜を用意し、材料を順番通りに投入して混ぜる。\n攪拌の際は、時計回りを三周、反時計回りを二周、中身が極彩の黒色になるまで、ひたすらこれを繰り返す。","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":"no_source_text"},"say:11:1064009006:1":{"text":"思うんだけど……この混沌と虚空の暗黒召喚鍋って、本当に魔法薬じゃないの？","source_cn":"说真的……混沌虚空之黑暗召唤锅真的不是魔药吗？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x3A9BC8F74CE5ED9D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1064009007:1":{"text":"太古の生き物の骨、海底生物の肝臓、精神系モンスターの肉に元素エキス……","source_cn":"远古生物骨骼、海底生物肝脏、精神系的怪物肉，还有元素精华……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xF77096EF94D29E78","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1064009008:1":{"text":"くわえて、この大釜……","source_cn":"再加上这个熬煮的大坩埚。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xCCBA03E1EE2985B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1064009009:1":{"text":"変な臭いがする黒っぽい魔法薬ができる予感しかしないんだけど……もしかしたら、爆発したりして……","source_cn":"感觉最后会是黑乎乎的散发着奇怪气息的魔药……说不定还会爆炸！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xD90290C0285D7E85","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1064009010:1":{"text":"薬になる食材だってたくさんある。作り方が似ていても別段問題はないだろう。","source_cn":"很多食物也是药物，食谱像药方也没有问题。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xA62540724855FB47","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1064009011:0":{"text":"それもそっか。","source_cn":"说得也是。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x720F79DD14017885","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1064009012:0":{"text":"マルシルは、それ以上は何も言わず、あなたと魔法陣を描くことに集中した。","source_cn":"玛露西尔安静了下来，和你一起专心地绘制魔法阵。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xB332E26D5BA98155","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1064009013:1":{"text":"しばらくしないうちに魔法陣が完成した。食材の下処理も完了し、あとは大釜で煮込むだけだ。","source_cn":"没过多久，魔法阵画好了。而所有的食材也处理完毕，只待下锅。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x0B4044A014BC5B7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:21:1064009013":{"text":"しばらくしないうちに魔法陣が完成した。食材の下処理も完了し、あとは大釜で煮込むだけだ。","source_cn":"没过多久，魔法阵画好了。而所有的食材也处理完毕，只待下锅。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x0B4044A014BC5B7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1064009014:0":{"text":"うん、始めましょう！","source_cn":"嗯，开始吧！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x719CB8FE60F5975A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1064009015:1":{"text":"まずは骨を釜に入れ、次に肝臓、そして肉だな……","source_cn":"先下远古生物骨骼，然后是海底生物肝脏和怪物肉——","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x8361FE53373E557A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1064009016:1":{"text":"残るは元素エキスだけだ。","source_cn":"只差元素精华了。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x10AA5E35436F9328","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1064009017:1":{"text":"それじゃ――","source_cn":"老夫要动——","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x57AA0C4AD835CA02","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1064009018:1":{"text":"待て！","source_cn":"等等！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x96B0E1F06C8062B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1064009019:1":{"text":"ライオス、邪魔しないで……","source_cn":"莱欧斯，你别捣乱——","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xCD28EBA92810D451","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1064009020:0":{"text":"って……今喋ったの、ライオスじゃない！？","source_cn":"不对，不是面前的莱欧斯在说话！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xC06CC7BDF68A085F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1064009021:0":{"text":"あそこだ！虫に乗って、こっちに飛んでくる……ライオス？","source_cn":"是那个……骑在虫上飞来的莱欧斯……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x054BA4D79A6F8071","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1064009022:0":{"text":"ら、ライオスが二人！？","source_cn":"两、两个莱欧斯？！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xF64DCF22D836DE91","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1064009023:0":{"text":"あなたたちの目の前で、巨大な幻晶ビートルが大釜に向かって飛んできた。","source_cn":"你们放眼望去，一只巨大的幻晶犀甲虫正飞向坩埚。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xACFA6B17AACCECE7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1064009024:0":{"text":"驚くことに、その背中にはライオスが乗っていて、必死な様子でこちらに手を振っている。","source_cn":"而在它的背上，坐着另一个莱欧斯！他正在拼命地向你们挥手示意。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x5D8B9C623AF236DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1064009025:1":{"text":"だ、誰だお前は！なぜ俺の姿になってるんだ？","source_cn":"你是谁？为什么你跟我一模一样？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x36059D3910180115","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1064009026:1":{"text":"とぼけるな！お前、俺達の足止めをするために、狂乱の魔術師が遣わした手下か！？","source_cn":"别装了！你是狂乱魔法师派来阻止我们回去的吗？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x97BF90C7318C1EFB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1064009027:1":{"text":"ケン助も警戒している。魔物め！正体を現せ！","source_cn":"剑助已经在示警了，魔物！老实交代吧！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xE407CDAB45646278","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1064009028:1":{"text":"お前こそ！召喚鍋を使って、良からぬことを企んでるんだろう！","source_cn":"你才是想借着召唤锅做什么坏事吧！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x32F651D3BAB2214A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1064009029:1":{"text":"い、一体どういうこと……？","source_cn":"这到底……是怎么回事？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xBF371534B49C4BC2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1064009030:1":{"text":"どうして、ライオスが二人いるの？","source_cn":"为什么会有两个莱欧斯？","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x453A0A0AB4C65F63","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1064009031:1":{"text":"はぁ、最後の最後でこんなことに……","source_cn":"怎么事到临头反而出了大问题啊。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x71FD3491D63AE94D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1064009032:1":{"text":"まずは、どちらが本物のライオスか見極めないといかんな。","source_cn":"看来，我们得先弄清楚谁是真正的莱欧斯了。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x3A5B64BEC5278280","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:52:1064009032":{"text":"まずは、どちらが本物のライオスか見極めないといかんな。","source_cn":"看来，我们得先弄清楚谁是真正的莱欧斯了。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x3A5B64BEC5278280","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:54:1064009033:0":{"text":"ライオスは魔物の知識が豊富なんだ。ひとまずそれで確かめてみるか。","source_cn":"莱欧斯有着丰富的魔物知识，我先用这个考考他们。","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0xB3BA8F04C91A168E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:55:1064009034:1":{"text":"おい、ライオス。こんな状況を作り出せる魔物に心当たりは？","source_cn":"喂，两个莱欧斯。说说看造就两个莱欧斯的魔物。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x7CD91571F9C5214D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:57:1064009035:1":{"text":"ひとつはシェイプシフターだな。獲物の思考や記憶を読んで、その姿を真似るんだ。","source_cn":"首先是变身怪，可以读取猎物的思维和记忆来伪装他人。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xD96361876483168A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:58:1064009036:1":{"text":"ドッペルゲンガーの可能性もある。他の生き物に擬態できる魔物だ。","source_cn":"其次是变形怪，这是可以拟态成其他生物的魔物。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xBF188E2D4C0C9874","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:59:1064009037:1":{"text":"他の魔法生物の可能性もあるが……","source_cn":"别的魔法生物也有可能……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x5FE4DA31D1A7FC52","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:60:1064009038:1":{"text":"似たような能力を持つ悪魔もいるな……","source_cn":"部分恶魔也具有这种能力……","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x4DADC3B8314C81A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:62:1064009039:1":{"text":"だめだ……どっちも魔物に詳しい。","source_cn":"行不通……两个人都对魔物了如指掌。","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0x8E9B7FF7922A2EBD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:64:1064009040:1":{"text":"私にもやらせて！","source_cn":"我来试试！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xF2590D0EBB6A7545","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:65:1064009041:1":{"text":"ふたりとも、犬の鳴き真似をやってみて！似てる方が本物のライオスよ！","source_cn":"你们两个，学狗叫。谁学的最像谁就是莱欧斯！","status":"matched_luae","hash_xxh64":"0xB816FE844049AC59","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:68:1064009042:1":{"text":"ヴォウ！ヴォウッ！ヴァウッ！！","source_cn":"汪汪汪——汪汪——","status":"m